  "canon:pmid": "10692744",
  "canon:title": "Acetazolamide-induced Gerstmann syndrome.",
  "canon:abstract": "Acute confusion induced by acetazolamide is a well known adverse drug reaction in patients with renal impairment. We report a case of acetazolamide-induced Gerstmann syndrome in a patient with normal renal function, to highlight predisposing factors that are frequently overlooked.",
  "canon:text": "Acetazolamide-induced Gerstmann syndrome. Acute confusion induced by acetazolamide is a well known adverse drug reaction in patients with renal impairment. We report a case of acetazolamide-induced Gerstmann syndrome in a patient with normal renal function, to highlight predisposing factors that are frequently overlooked.",
